## 3. Backend REST API Endpoints (`backend/main.py`)

- `GET /api/characters?q=<query>&limit=20`:
  - Returns matching characters ordered by `char_code ASC` for live auto-suggest.
  - Returns `{ char_code, canonical_name, series, avatar_url, hazard_score, hazard_class }`.
- `GET /api/characters/{char_code}`:
  - Returns full character record and all variants.
- `POST /api/characters`:
  - Upserts character definition into SQLite.
- `PUT /api/tournaments/{tournament_id}/slot/{slot_code}/select-character`:
  - Accepts `{ char_code: str }`.
  - Looks up `char_code` in SQLite `characters` table.
  - Sets `character_id`, `display_name`, and `avatar_url` on the slot.
  - Refuses assignment if `char_code` does not exist in SQLite.

